{"3337980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Only Fog Remains", "steam_appid": 3337980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cynthia went looking for an urban legend to document for a college project. By the time she arrived, her friends had already been rewritten by the fog.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Her only tool runs on batteries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/c478784990c1185042e43ce221b38252.poster.avif?t=1787776270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/c478784990c1185042e43ce221b38252.webm?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/c478784990c1185042e43ce221b38252.mp4?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tape turns a battery into something different: fast enough to outrun what's chasing her, quiet enough to slip by unseen, calm enough to keep her steady when everything else isn't.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rescue isn't the goal. Recognition is.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/647b0a6a99363158bb55c55be23f1a06.poster.avif?t=1787776270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/647b0a6a99363158bb55c55be23f1a06.webm?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/647b0a6a99363158bb55c55be23f1a06.mp4?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of Cynthia's three friends has been changed by the fog in a different way: personalities twisted, bonds broken. Finding them is just the start, figuring out who they've become and how to save them is a whole other question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A soundtrack with two moods, hers and the town's.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/036f9466f4dfc37d370675268a2d3ce4.poster.avif?t=1787776270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/036f9466f4dfc37d370675268a2d3ce4.webm?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/036f9466f4dfc37d370675268a2d3ce4.mp4?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ambient score grows heavier as Cynthia's stress rises. The tapes play their own songs, untouched by any of it: the one steady thing in a town that keeps changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Secrets lay within the town, yet to be discovered</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/b9b1b15b8047cd53c61b62e951bb43a8.poster.avif?t=1787776270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/b9b1b15b8047cd53c61b62e951bb43a8.webm?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/b9b1b15b8047cd53c61b62e951bb43a8.mp4?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival means paying attention. Reading the town's environment, solving its puzzles, and staying unseen. You're left to figure it out yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To sum it up:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person survival horror, no combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ hours of gameplay with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden radio to collect and replay every tape in full</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling through notes, puzzles, and the world itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly, PS1-era visuals</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cynthia went looking for an urban legend to document for a college project. By the time she arrived, her friends had already been rewritten by the fog.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Her only tool runs on batteries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/c478784990c1185042e43ce221b38252.poster.avif?t=1787776270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/c478784990c1185042e43ce221b38252.webm?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/c478784990c1185042e43ce221b38252.mp4?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tape turns a battery into something different: fast enough to outrun what's chasing her, quiet enough to slip by unseen, calm enough to keep her steady when everything else isn't.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rescue isn't the goal. Recognition is.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/647b0a6a99363158bb55c55be23f1a06.poster.avif?t=1787776270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/647b0a6a99363158bb55c55be23f1a06.webm?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/647b0a6a99363158bb55c55be23f1a06.mp4?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of Cynthia's three friends has been changed by the fog in a different way: personalities twisted, bonds broken. Finding them is just the start, figuring out who they've become and how to save them is a whole other question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A soundtrack with two moods, hers and the town's.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/036f9466f4dfc37d370675268a2d3ce4.poster.avif?t=1787776270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/036f9466f4dfc37d370675268a2d3ce4.webm?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/036f9466f4dfc37d370675268a2d3ce4.mp4?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ambient score grows heavier as Cynthia's stress rises. The tapes play their own songs, untouched by any of it: the one steady thing in a town that keeps changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Secrets lay within the town, yet to be discovered</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/b9b1b15b8047cd53c61b62e951bb43a8.poster.avif?t=1787776270\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/b9b1b15b8047cd53c61b62e951bb43a8.webm?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/b9b1b15b8047cd53c61b62e951bb43a8.mp4?t=1787776270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival means paying attention. Reading the town's environment, solving its puzzles, and staying unseen. You're left to figure it out yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To sum it up:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person survival horror, no combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ hours of gameplay with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden radio to collect and replay every tape in full</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling through notes, puzzles, and the world itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly, PS1-era visuals</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "She came in search of a ghost story to record, but is now part of it. With only a cassette player in hand, Cynthia must now traverse the fog and search for her friends before it changes them forever.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin A